<title>USA: TABLE - PartnerRe Ltd Q2 shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - PartnerRe Ltd Q2 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.15		    $1.13</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.12		     1.10</p>
<p> Net			 60,444		   60,285</p>
<p> Revs			69,029		   71,561</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  53,919		   54,738</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.30		    $2.36</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 2.25		     2.30</p>
<p> Net			121,165		  128,261</p>
<p> Revs		     141,678		  152.558</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  53,934		   55,712</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: On an operating basis, excluding net realized investment losses  of $900,000, or $0,02 per share, 1997 Q2 earnings were $61.3 million or $1.14 per share.</p>
<p>Excluding net realized investment losses of $2 million, or $0.04 per share, Q2 1996 earnings were $62.3 million, or $1.14 per share.</p>
<p>The company, which offers reinsurance, is based in Pembroke, Bermuda.</p>
